# Changelog

## [0.2.0] - 2026-11-20

Scaffolding and development tooling update.

### Added

- Account domain, handler, service, repository interface, PostgreSQL repository, and test placeholders.
- Onboarding workflow, review update, activities, and application, account, third-party, and SendGrid client placeholders.
- Account and worker command placeholders and an application domain status placeholder.
- Application PostgreSQL repository and test placeholders.
- GitHub Actions CI for protobuf lint and generation consistency, Go formatting, static analysis, race-enabled tests, and builds.
- Makefile targets for generation, verification, builds, local services, and Docker Compose commands.
- AGENTS.md with project engineering and human review instructions.

### Implementation Status

- Account and worker commands have no `main` functions and cannot yet build as executables.
- New business logic, persistence, workflows, activities, clients, and tests are placeholders.
- Temporal and PostgreSQL dependencies, database migrations, and Docker Compose configuration are not yet included.
- Existing application and third-party servers continue to register unimplemented RPC handlers.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-11-14

Initial scaffold release.

### Added

- Application and third-party protobuf contracts with generated Go types and Connect RPC bindings.
- Application HTTP server on port 8080 and third-party HTTP server on port 8081, each with a health endpoint.
- Placeholder application domain, handler, repository, and service packages, plus third-party handler, service, and mock packages.
- API design documentation and Buf configuration for protobuf generation.
- README covering the project, current structure, API endpoints, and local startup instructions.
- VERSION file initialized to 0.1.0.

### Implementation Status

- Both servers register generated unimplemented RPC handlers. Business workflows, persistence, and third-party mocks remain placeholders.
